/*
  SOCRouteChart.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0176 · SOCRouteChart (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SOCRouteChart` resolves (table "SOCRouteChart") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/SOCRouteChart.tsx). The remainder back the labels the
  web renders as literals (the "Min %", "Stop N", "km" overlays — keyed here so no
  English literal lives in native code) plus the native state envelope (freshness
  chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome) and the accessibility
  summaries.
*/

